## 📊 Model Performance

| Disease | Algorithm | Accuracy | CV Score |
|---------|-----------|----------|----------|
| Diabetes | Gradient Boosting | 74% | 76% ± 2.9% |
| Heart Disease | Random Forest | 98% | 97% ± 1.2% |
| Kidney Disease | Random Forest | 98% | 99% ± 1.0% |
| Chest X-Ray | CNN (4 layers) | 95% | - |

## 🚀 Features
- 🩺 4 ML/DL Disease Prediction Models
- 🤖 MediBot AI Chatbot (Groq LLaMA)
- 📱 WhatsApp Bot via Twilio
- 🇮🇳 Hindi/English language toggle
- 🎤 Voice Input support
- 📊 Real-time Analytics Dashboard
- 💾 SQLite Database
- 📱 Mobile Responsive

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Backend:** Python, Flask, SQLite, Scikit-learn, TensorFlow
- **Frontend:** React.js, Tailwind CSS, Recharts
- **AI:** Groq API (LLaMA 3.3 70B), Twilio
- **Deploy:** Vercel + PythonAnywhere

## 🔧 Local Setup

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm start
```

